{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 1, "text": "I have completed a full source-fidelity review of the entire patent application draft against the authoritative inventor sources. The review traced every limitation in all 22 claims, every numbered part in the specification and figure briefs, and every asserted structure, relationship, and material in the description and abstract. The inventor's disclosure in `input/disclosure.md` and `input/conversation.md` was the sole authority for technical content. The review also verified internal consistency across all documents. One minor internal inconsistency was found where the detailed description's characterization of the transverse center index mark is ambiguous and conflicts with the more specific description in the corresponding figure brief. A corrective finding has been prepared to resolve this inconsistency. All other aspects of the draft were found to be source-faithful and internally consistent."}
